<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS3.SSS0.Px3" title="In 5.3 More Analysis ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ Image Tokenizer Needs Post-Training" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Ablation for tokenizer post-training.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS3.SSS0.Px4" title="In 5.3 More Analysis ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ Image Tokenizer Needs Post-Training" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Qualitative results.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In Image Tokenizer Needs Post-Training" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6 </span>Conclusion</span></a></li>
