For fair comparison, we randomly select 200,000 images from ImageNet training set. Baseline represents the original gFID using original checkpoints from
MAETok (a) <span id="A1.T10.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">without finetuning</span> and (b) <span id="A1.T10.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">with latent noise finetuning</span>.</figcaption>
